      "content": "i don't know if i want to find strength. honestly, every time i look at his side of the bed, it just feels like a constant reminder that my life is over too. it's like i'm just a ghost haunting a house that doesn't belong to me anymore. i'm just so tired of fighting to exist in a world where he isn't.",
